# Portfolio 2: Query Processing and Optimisation

## Project Overview

This portfolio focuses on SQL query processing, execution and optimisation using PostgreSQL 18.

The project uses the PensionPay Fintech Pension Contribution Management System developed in Portfolio 1.

## Objectives
- Develop and execute SQL queries.
- Analyse pension contribution records.
- Examine query execution plans.
- Apply indexing techniques.
- Evaluate query performance.

## Tools
- PostgreSQL 18
- pgAdmin 4
- GitHub

